sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Istio IngressGateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant QueueProxy as Knative Activator/<br/>Queue-Proxy<br/>8012/TCP mTLS
    participant Caikit as Caikit Runtime<br/>(transformer-container)<br/>8080/TCP HTTP | 8085/TCP gRPC
    participant TGIS as TGIS Backend<br/>(kserve-container)<br/>8033/TCP gRPC
    participant Models as /mnt/models/<br/>PVC Mount
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>(openshift-user-workload-monitoring)

    Note over Client,TGIS: Flow 1: HTTP Text Generation Inference

    Client->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/task/text-generation<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+, TLS passthrough
    Gateway->>QueueProxy: Forward request<br/>HTTP/8012, mTLS (Istio), PeerAuthentication
    QueueProxy->>Caikit: Route to transformer-container<br/>HTTP/8080, mTLS (Istio sidecar), PeerAuthentication
    Caikit->>TGIS: Inference request<br/>gRPC/8033, plaintext (localhost), no auth
    TGIS->>Models: Load model artifacts
    Models-->>TGIS: Model weights (Caikit format)
    TGIS-->>Caikit: Inference result
    Caikit-->>QueueProxy: JSON response
    QueueProxy-->>Gateway: Forward response
    Gateway-->>Client: HTTPS response<br/>TLS 1.2+

    Note over Client,TGIS: Flow 2: gRPC Text Generation Inference

    Client->>Gateway: gRPC TextGenerationTaskPredict<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+, h2c upgrade
    Gateway->>QueueProxy: Forward gRPC<br/>gRPC/HTTP2/8012, mTLS (Istio), PeerAuthentication
    QueueProxy->>Caikit: Route to transformer-container<br/>gRPC/HTTP2/8085, mTLS (Istio sidecar), PeerAuthentication
    Caikit->>TGIS: Inference request<br/>gRPC/8033, plaintext (localhost)
    TGIS-->>Caikit: Inference result
    Caikit-->>QueueProxy: gRPC response
    QueueProxy-->>Gateway: Forward response
    Gateway-->>Client: gRPC/HTTP2 response<br/>TLS 1.2+

    Note over Client,TGIS: Flow 3: Streaming Text Generation (HTTP)

    Client->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/task/server-streaming-text-generation<br/>HTTPS/443
    Gateway->>QueueProxy: Forward<br/>HTTP/8012, mTLS
    QueueProxy->>Caikit: Stream request<br/>HTTP/8080, mTLS
    Caikit->>TGIS: Streaming inference<br/>gRPC/8033 (localhost)
    loop Token-by-token streaming
        TGIS-->>Caikit: Partial result
        Caikit-->>QueueProxy: Stream chunk
        QueueProxy-->>Gateway: Forward chunk
        Gateway-->>Client: SSE/streaming chunk
    end

    Note over Prometheus,Caikit: Flow 4: Prometheus Metrics Scraping

    Prometheus->>Caikit: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP/8086, PERMISSIVE mTLS, no auth
    Caikit-->>Prometheus: caikit_* metrics
